  "title": "MapSpawnSession",
  "description": "The objects one spawn produced, and their shared lifetime. A session is handed out by import('./MapObjectSpawner').MapObjectSpawner.spawn and owns every result in it. Destroying the session destroys them all; nothing else has to be tracked, and nothing scans the scene to find them again. A session is not reusable - destroy it and spawn again.",
