          "params": [],
          "returnType": "void",
          "description": "Destroy every spawned object, in reverse spawn order. Idempotent; objects still lists what the session held. Reverse order is the contract, not an implementation detail: an object spawned later may have attached itself to an earlier one (a turret to its platform, a light to its lamp), and tearing down the dependent first is the order that never observes a half-destroyed owner."
        },
