          "description": "The object spawned from the source object with this import('./MapObject').MapObjectDescriptor.id, or undefined when no object with that id spawned anything. Constant time. The ids are the source-stable ones, which is what makes this the hook for savegame restoration: persist the id, look the runtime object back up."
